    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810378c1ab0603b6de03efc5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "考虑到没有外出计划的赛马娘们、\n每年这都是一场自由进出的、\n可以轻松享受的派对――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f78850386303ea76357801d85d47b0cb4af683846361760d872f47cc5191ddfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
